      `my child goes to, or is to enrol at, a government school` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Whether your child attends, or is to be enrolled at, a government school (the enrolment rules of ss 75-79 and the fees and charges of ss 97-106 are for government schools only)
      `the residence` IS A `My child's residence` @desc Where your child lives and their residence or visa status
      `of compulsory school age` IS A BOOLEAN @desc Whether your child is of compulsory school age (for s 29, this includes a child under a s 11D or 11H notice, s 29(1a))
      `the school` IS A `The school's offer` @desc Whether you live in the school's intake area, and what it has available
GIVETH A `Yes or no`
